{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Take flight with <i>Jack Barau</i> and get a tropical taste of his high-flying adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suit up in feathers and explore the island of R\u00e9union as Jack, a grumpy (but lovable) <strong>Barau\u2019s petrel</strong> doing his best to protect his home turf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What\u2019s in the demo</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The beginning of Jack\u2019s story \u2014 a charming, light-hearted adventure with quirky characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve clever puzzles by dodging <strong>yellow lights</strong> and avoiding <strong>pesky predators!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soar through unique environments, chat with oddball allies, and enjoy the island vibes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a feel for the core gameplay, introduces key characters, and sets the stage for the full journey to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Jack Barau</i> blends thoughtful puzzles, humor, and the spirit of R\u00e9union into a 2.5D narrative adventure \u2014 <strong>fully hand-drawn</strong> from beak to tail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642120/extras/Steam_Petrel_LD.gif?t=1744826720\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642120?t=1744826720","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642120/0d00a78ff90fbaf9fa8af0d54a2db3eace95e073/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744826720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642120/d64f14e51e03be0f760e94bb6370f006994d1e28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744826720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642120/d64f14e51e03be0f7